{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02827","headline":"羁卧山中 · 卢照邻","name":"羁卧山中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧壑迷时代，行歌任死生。\n红颜意气尽，白璧故交轻。\n涧户无人迹，山窗听鸟声。\n春色缘岩上，寒光入溜平。\n雪尽松帷暗，云开石路明。\n夜伴饥鼯宿，朝随驯雉行。\n度溪犹忆处，寻洞不知名。\n紫书常日阅，丹药几年成。\n扣钟鸣天鼓，烧香厌地精。\n倘遇浮丘鹤，飘颻凌太清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}